    <string name="instructions_title">Instructions</string>
    <string name="tiltmeter_usage_instructions">1. Select Mode: Choose Fixed, Daily, or 30-Day optimization.\n2. Position Phone: Place device flat on the solar panel, screen facing up.\n3. Align Azimuth: Rotate the panel horizontally until the compass arrow points to the target.\n4. Adjust Tilt: Angle the panel vertically until the bubble centers and matches the target.\n5. Done: The screen turns green when alignment is accurate (&lt; 5°).</string>
