    <string name="satellite_tiltmeter_instructions">1. Automatic Data: The app fetches the optimal satellite (SARAH3) angle for your location.\n2. Manual Verification (Optional): Click link below. On site: Select \"PVGIS-SARAH3\", check \"Optimize slope\", and \"Visualize results\".\n3. Position Phone: Place device flat on the solar panel.\n4. Adjust Panel: Rotate to align the compass and tilt up/down to match the target angle.\n5. Done: The screen turns green when alignment is accurate (&lt; 5°).</string>
    
